  "releaseNotes": "1.0.1: the ready-made Leaderboards list works offline. It used to say \"No leaderboards yet\" without a connection; it now shows the list kept on the device, and each leaderboard opens with its own copy and the player's waiting best. New: Leaderboards.ListAsync, which keeps the list for offline the way LoadAsync keeps each leaderboard. Fixed: leaderboards and news kept on the device did not show when the app was opened without a connection. Seasons: a leaderboard page now offers every past season the leaderboard keeps (it used to offer only the last one), named the way your team set in the dashboard (e.g. \"Today\", \"Round 12\", in each language added), or Today / Yesterday, This week / Last week, This month / Last month and dates when no name is set; \"Season ends\" now reads \"Ends\". New: Leaderboards.SeasonsAsync and CachedSeasons, and GetLeaderboardPage(key, season) to open one at a past season. See https://beeappie.com/changelog for what changes in each version.",
